{"term":{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001151","compactId":"SO_0001151","id":"SO:0001151","label":"beta_turn_type_six_a","definition":{"text":"A motif of four consecutive peptide residues, of which the i+2 residue is proline, and that may contain one H-bond, which, if present, is between the main-chain CO of the first residue and the main-chain NH of the fourth and is characterized by the dihedral angles: Residue(i+1): phi ~ -60 degrees, psi ~ 120 degrees. Residue(i+2): phi ~ -90 degrees, psi ~ 0 degrees.","xrefs":["PMID:2371257","SO:cb"]},"comments":[],"synonyms":[{"scope":"exact","value":"beta turn type six a"},{"scope":"exact","value":"type VIa beta turn"},{"scope":"exact","value":"type VIa turn"}],"xrefs":[],"subsets":["biosapiens"],"altIds":[],"namespace":"sequence","isObsolete":false,"replacedBy":[],"canonicalUrl":"/browser/current_release/term/SO:0001151/","history":{"firstSeen":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]},"mostRecent":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]},"entries":[{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]}],"semanticEvents":[{"type":"created","date":"2016-12-05","commit":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","subject":"Add renamed SO files","summary":"Term introduced into the editable ontology history","details":["Initial label: beta_turn_type_six_a","Initial definition captured.","Initial parent: SO:0001150"],"issueRefs":[]}]},"parents":["SO:0001150"],"children":["SO:0001152","SO:0001153"],"ancestors":["SO:0001150","SO:0001133","SO:0001128","SO:0001078","SO:0001070","SO:0000839","SO:0001411","SO:0000001","SO:0000110"],"descendants":["SO:0001152","SO:0001153"],"relationships":[],"graphNeighborhood":{"parent